DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Tenant HAS name IS A STRING

DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Sign HAS signer IS AN Actor

closingDate MEANS 20

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
contract MEANS
    EVERY Tenant t
        MUST   Sign (EXACTLY t)
        WITHIN 14 OF THE ARMING
        ONCE   ALL HAVE WITHIN 30 OF closingDate
        HENCE  (PARTY t MUST Sign (EXACTLY t) WITHIN 5 OF THE DEADLINE)
        LEST   BREACH
